=== TUYEN BO TANG TOC BI ANH HUONG THE NAO ===
  Bang II cua bai ghi 'UE, SO (MSA) T ~ 20' khong kem dieu kien.
  do duoc: lanh 20 vong, am 4 vong.
  => neu doi thu la MSA AM thi tang toc phai chia cho 5.6x:
       21x bao trong bai  ->  ~3.8x so voi MSA am
       22x bao trong bai  ->  ~3.9x so voi MSA am
       29x bao trong bai  ->  ~5.2x so voi MSA am

  Con so nao vao bai la tuy KICH BAN TRIEN KHAI, va bai phai NOI ro kich ban do:
  mot he dieu hanh giu duoc can bang lat truoc thi doi thu dung la MSA am.
